              "type": "string",
              "value": "Flatten the array in case there is any nested array of objects: {{$context.$nodes.CREATE_RESERVATION_SUGGESTIONS_LOOP.$output}}\nNOTE: Only output the array of objects if nothing is present output an empty array.\nFinal output is an array of JSONs. \nDo not use any markdown highlighting for the Array"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
